    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How many oz in a quart?</h3>
        <p>There are 32 US fluid ounces in 1 US quart. To convert ounces to quarts, divide by 32. So 16 oz = 0.5 qt, 32 oz = 1 qt, 64 oz = 2 qt.</p>
